---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Janata Pratisthan" description="Privacy information for visitors to the Janata Pratisthan website.">
  <main id="main-content" class="section">
    <article class="container article">
      <header class="article-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Transparency</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="muted">Last updated: 27 October 2026 · Review and confirm this policy before launch.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>This page is a starter template and must be reviewed against the organisation's actual practices before it is treated as a final privacy policy.</p>
        <h2>Information we may receive</h2>
        <p>If contact, volunteer, or newsletter forms are connected in the future, the organisation may receive information that a visitor chooses to provide, such as a name, email address, or message. Do not submit sensitive personal information through this website.</p>
        <h2>How information is used</h2>
        <p>Information should be used only for the purpose explained when it is collected, such as responding to a message or sending requested community updates. The current newsletter form is not connected to a mailing-list service and does not store subscriptions.</p>
        <h2>Sharing and retention</h2>
        <p>Before collecting personal information, the organisation should document which service providers process it, how long it is retained, how it is protected, and when it may be shared where legally required.</p>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>For privacy questions or requests, contact the organisation using its verified official contact details. Add the correct contact email here before launch.</p>
        <h2>Policy updates</h2>
        <p>This policy may be updated when website features or data practices change. Publish the effective date of each substantive revision.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
